t the  witch's fortress of care more than ass  can also be seen from a mural of a  warrior fighting a monster  a classic witch's activity likewise of  interest is an ornate dare that could  have come from the school of the viper  this is especially noteworthy since the  witcher's guild is an invention of the  video games and does not  appear in the books in addition at the  request of many fans the nilfgaardian  troops armor has been redesigned after  it didn't look very satisfactory in the  first season  there are certainly even more clues  which is why we are interested in what  you noticed in the short teaser  feel free to write it down in the  comments you will probably be able to  watch the second season of the witcher  in december but unfortunately there is  no official release date  yet we are still about a year away from  the release of jurassic world dominion  but to the delight of many fans there's  some exciting news about the third part  of the series  the first news involves a new image  shared by director colin trevorrow  on it can be seen a small feathered  dinosaur which seems to be making a mess  of the remains of a larger one  after many fans wondered about this  species trevorrow announced the  scientific name of the creature  namely moro's intrepidus the small  detail with the feathers is also  deliberately staged in such a way  after all some scientific studies show  the dinosaurs were at least partially  covered with feathers  the leading paleontologists are still  not quite in agreement about the  feathers but nonetheless it is great to  see that scientific findings are dealt  with in the movie in addition  there was already your first official  movie poster to admire  besides the mosquito which is very  important for the franchise you can also  see a preview of an exclusive offer from  universal  if you go to watch the new fast and  furious 9 in an imax theater you will  get to see a 5 minute preview of  jurassic world in advance  this snippe