duced  at all  we are now pleased to announce that  shooting of the upcoming indiana jones 5  has already begun it seems that james  mangold who replaced the originally  planned director steven spielberg at his  request  is the right man to direct the fifth  indiana jones movie  the film is barely in full swing and yet  the first unofficial photos from the set  have  already surfaced and they do reveal  quite a bit about the plot of the  upcoming film  they show hints of a third reich setting  as can be seen from the train or the  vermont uniforms  moreover there are indication that this  might be some sort of flashback  possibly with ford's facial features  rejuvenated on the computer  we are definitely eager to see if and  how the scene will appear in the final  film  and are looking forward to the release  date of indiana jones 5 on july 29th  2022 it has been known for over a year  that disney has plans for a prequel  series to beauty and the beast  after there had been no news for a long  time disney recently communicated that  the series is now  officially in production as has been  evident for some time  fans can look forward to gaston lefou  though an appearance by emma watson as  belle and dan stevens as the beast  should not be expected the internal  working title of the disney plus series  is  beauty and the beast and in addition to  luke evans gaston and josh gaddis lefou  brianna middleton is now joining the  cast in her role as lefou's stepsister  tilly as the synopsis states the trio  will embark on a journey filled with  romance  comedy and adventure as they uncover  secrets of their past  behind the scenes lead actor josh gad  and his colleagues edward kitchis and  adam horowitz are responsible for the  production  filming of the series is expected to  begin in spring 2022  yet an official release date has not  been announced so far  [Music]

